Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tooth hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.55,0:00:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It is fourteen\Nthousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no dental\Nclinic down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So did people\Nsimply do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.25,0:00:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At Villabruna, in\Nnorthern Italy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,researchers studied\Na human molar with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,cavity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside it, they found\Ntiny scratches and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,chipped enamel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiments suggested\Nthat pointed flint
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,tools had scraped\Nthe cavity while the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,person was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Think careful scraping,\Nnot a modern
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,dentist's drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is evidence of\Nan attempt to treat a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,damaged tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It does not tell us\Nexactly how it felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,who helped, or\Nwhether the treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The person holding\Ntheir cheek here is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,imaginary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient\Ntooth is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors\Nhad serious skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I would still rather\Nbook an appointment.
